154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (Quantum computers leverage superposition and entaglement to explore many possible solutions simultaneously, making these problems easy to solve. Since quantum computers can break traditional encryption, researchers are developing post-quantum cryptographic algorithms that rely on mathematical problems not susceptible to known quantum attacks. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
